    "## Research Questions and Hypotheses\n",
    "1.\tHow have Bitcoin (BTC) and Ethereum (ETH) prices changed over the last two years?\n",
    "  * Null Hypothesis (H₀₁): There is no significant long-term upward trend in BTC or ETH prices.\n",
    "  * Alternative Hypothesis (H₁₁): Both BTC and ETH have shown a significant upward trend over time.\n",
    "2.\tWhich cryptocurrency shows higher volatility?\n",
    "  * Null Hypothesis (H₀₂): There is no difference in volatility between BTC and ETH.\n",
    "  * Alternative Hypothesis (H₁₂): Ethereum (ETH) is more volatile than Bitcoin (BTC).\n",
    "3.\tAre BTC and ETH correlated?\n",
    "  * Null Hypothesis (H₀₃): There is no correlation between BTC and ETH daily returns.\n",
    "  * Alternative Hypothesis (H₁₃): BTC and ETH daily returns are positively correlated."
